# LeakSanitizer suppressions for narval-gui: what SDL's X11 video driver
# leaves behind in Xlib (the input method and the resource database it
# opens once per process, never closed). Nothing of narval's own: galloc's
# exit report covers that. Usage:
#   LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=tools/lsan-gui.supp build-asan/narval-gui
leak:X11_InitKeyboard
leak:GetGlobalContentScale
